@crew v-kalnins-zora
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hello. Zora Kalnins. I draw the charts. Have you seen a pencil? Two?
- Mm, hi. Sorry. I was somewhere else. A nebula, mostly.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I found both pencils. They were behind my ears.   #funny
?

== chat
- I stay up late. The stars are easier to draw when everyone's asleep.
- Every chart has a little drawing in the corner. Nobody asked me to. I just do.

== near
? time:night
- Quiet ship. Clear window. Best time to draw.
? deck:2
- The observatory dome hums. Did you know? A low hum. Like a cat.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If you see a star I've missed, tell me. I'll draw it for you.   #warm

== smalltalk
- Mm. Left pencil.
- There it is. Oh, lovely.
